    <h3>What does it do, exactly?</h3>
    <p>Think of Is It Yacht Rock? as Shazam meets <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ACmydtFDTGs">Not Hot Dog</a>. The app exists solely to help you identify what songs are officially Yacht or Nyacht as determined by the experts at <a href="https://sites.libsyn.com/483279/">the eponymous podcast</a>.</p>
